        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**Yes. One component-issue event for manufacturing order `MO-25-09-1070` was created 145 minutes after September entered Pending Close, but its recorded accounting status is `POSTED`.**\n\n### Event identified\n\n| Item | Finding |\n|---|---|\n| Operation | Modine, Racine |\n| Manufacturing order | `MO-25-09-1070` |\n| Work order ID | `WO-2025-09-004` — Cooler Plate Pack |\n| Cost event ID | `CE-250904-0004` |\n| Source transaction | `TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070` |\n| Event type | `INPUT` — “Component issue after pending close” |\n| Amount | **USD $318,250.75** (`31,825,075` cents) |\n| Cost period | `Sep-25` / `PER-COST-2025-09` |\n| Exact event-created time | **`2025-09-30T20:25:00`** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **`2025-09-30T18:00:00`** |\n| Time after Pending Close | **145 minutes — 2 hours, 25 minutes** |\n| Recorded accounting status | **`POSTED`** |\n\nCalculation: `20:25:00 − 18:00:00 = 8,700 seconds ÷ 60 = 145 minutes`. The source timestamps do not specify a timezone or UTC offset.\n\n### Oracle policy conclusion\n\n**The recorded `POSTED` status is inconsistent with Oracle’s documented Pending Close treatment for this event.** Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B states that newly created transactions falling in the pending-close period or an earlier period are not staged in Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting; they are processed after the period is closed or reopened.\n\nOracle permits continued processing of revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments. This event is an ordinary **component issue (`INPUT`)**, not one of those exceptions.\n\n**Sources:** `system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db`, tables `work_orders`, `cost_periods`, and `work_order_cost_events`; Oracle policy section **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,”** PDF page **233**, printed page **225**.\n\nThe review was read-only; **no database records were changed**. The audit report was submitted and verified, and saved at `/cache/work/worker_f202f74e333d/audit-report.json`.",
